      "writtenOn": "2022-03-04T01:19:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think ideally the decision should be in Fluoride/GD (below topshim). Connectable-ness depends on many factors, e.g. whether there is an RFCOMM service. I wonder how Android does it. For now I am okay with doing it at this layer, but in the meantime I think we should study how Android does it (and why) and maybe we can make design decision better from that information.\n\nMaybe Jesse could dig and give us some pointers on how Android does this?",
